Raw output behind springsim-grid-0911.md and springshare-0911.md, 2026-09-11.
Every figure quoted in either document appears below. All of it was taken on
AvatarSample_C_webp.vrm unless a line says otherwise.

=== 1. Stage profile of the frame loop =========================================
An instrumented copy of springsim.ts with performance.now() around skinAll(),
topOf(), grid construction and the Grid.signed() calls. Clip `akimbo`.

  PROFILE over 411 measured frames, 1738.0s accounted:
  skin   36.7s  2.1%
  top    0.7s  0.0%
  grid   2.7s  0.2%
  query  1697.9s  97.7%

1738.0 is the sum of the four stages, not a process wall clock. The four
percentages are each stage over that sum. 1697.9 / 36.7 = 46.3, which is the
"46 to 1" in the docblock.

=== 2. Set sizes and grid occupancy ============================================
Same clip, first measured frame. These are the PRE-FIX numbers, before gather
